---
system: sys-04-realtime-session-orchestrator
flow_id: turn-pipeline
surface: device
spec_anchor: /software/systems/04-realtime-session-orchestrator#turn-pipeline
actors: [Device, Orchestrator, GoogleLiveFlash, SafetyService, ContentService]
apis:
  - POST /internal/v1/conversation/generate
  - POST /internal/v1/personalization/retrieve
externals: [GoogleLiveFlash]
queues:
  - tbot-session-telemetry
failure_paths:
  - stt_timeout
  - input_safety_blocked
  - llm_timeout
  - output_safety_blocked
  - tts_timeout
idempotency: turnId monotonic per session, AUDIO_CHUNK seq strictly monotonic
retry: 0 (per-provider failover, fail-closed on safety)
timeout: end-of-speech to first TTS audio 1400ms p95 — STT 2000ms hard, LLM first token 3000ms hard
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED — normalized from _seed.1 (04-realtime#L101).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device
    participant Orchestrator
    participant GoogleLiveFlash
    participant SafetyService
    participant ContentService

    Device->>Orchestrator: AUDIO_CHUNK (0x10) seq=N streaming
    Device->>Orchestrator: AUDIO_END (0x11)
    Orchestrator->>GoogleLiveFlash: stream audio (bidirectional)
    GoogleLiveFlash-->>Orchestrator: STT_PARTIAL stream
    Orchestrator-->>Device: STT_PARTIAL (0x20)
    GoogleLiveFlash-->>Orchestrator: STT_FINAL transcript
    Orchestrator-->>Device: STT_FINAL (0x21)
    Orchestrator->>ContentService: POST /internal/v1/personalization/retrieve
    ContentService-->>Orchestrator: {traits, prefs, memories, templates}
    Orchestrator->>SafetyService: POST /internal/v1/conversation/generate
    alt input_safety_blocked
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: block_with_fallback fallback_text
        Orchestrator->>GoogleLiveFlash: synthesize fallback (TTS)
    else llm_timeout
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: model_timeout fallback
        Orchestrator->>GoogleLiveFlash: synthesize fallback (TTS)
    else output_safety_blocked
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: block_with_fallback after output gate
        Orchestrator->>GoogleLiveFlash: synthesize fallback (TTS)
    else success
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: allow {textSegments, renderPlan, motionPlan}
        Orchestrator-->>Device: LLM_TOKEN (0x30) stream
        Orchestrator->>GoogleLiveFlash: synthesize TTS Neural2
        GoogleLiveFlash-->>Orchestrator: TTS audio stream
        Orchestrator-->>Device: TTS_AUDIO (0x40) + EXPRESSION_SYNC (0x50)
        Orchestrator-->>Device: TTS_DONE (0x41)
    end
    Orchestrator-)Orchestrator: emit tbot-session-telemetry turn.completed

    Note over Device,GoogleLiveFlash: target 700ms p50 end-of-speech to first TTS audio — fail-closed on safety filter unavailability
